// 9 V PP3 (ANSI 1604A / IEC 6LR61 / 6LF22) alkaline battery with snap clip and 2-pin lead.
// Thevenin model: 9.0 V open-circuit EMF (Energizer 522) in series with 1.7 ohm fresh internal
// resistance (Duracell MN1604 1700 mohm impedance at 1 kHz and 21 C; Energizer 522 publishes
// no IR and Energizer's IR bulletin notes DC effective resistance is higher). Current warns
// past 50 mA, the highest continuous load plotted on Energizer 522 (1 s time constant from
// its 1 s smoke-detector pulse).
